    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>You perform a religious ceremony. The effect depends on the type of ceremony conducted.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Birth / Christening</strong>: Supernatural creatures must succeed at a hard save if they want to touch the baby.</li>\n<li><strong>Coming of Age</strong>: Grant the target an icon relationship point (if it doesn&rsquo;t have any yet).</li>\n<li><strong>Marriage</strong>: Both partners get a +1 bonus to saves for one month.</li>\n<li><strong>Funeral</strong>: The soul is safely guided to the afterlife, and the body cannot be raised as undead.</li>\n<li><strong>Oath</strong>: If the target breaks the oath, it is weakened (save ends).</li>\n<li><strong>Spring Rites</strong>: Bless the fertility of livestock.</li>\n<li><strong>Harvest</strong>: Increase the harvest, and protect the harvested crop from pests and fouling.</li>\n<li><strong>Foundation stone ceremony</strong>: Protect the construction site from accidents.</li>\n<li><strong>Topping out ceremony</strong>: The building is protected from fire and lightning for a year.</li>\n<li><strong>Door blessing</strong>: Supernatural creatures must succeed at a save to enter the house.</li>\n</ul>"
    },
